# Text is authored and stored with LF: the Rust source, the .mjs scripts and the
# NSIS include are used across shells and toolchains, and git's CRLF translation
# on checkout only produces churn (and broke a patch script's anchors once).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.ttf binary
